{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10002_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:336ababac562bd4e41dda46491265cd4b5bbe341b8e5e830d4e0ea45ab17b045",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a3207a84868c9856a05337053969479d4b8ba27de6020c39a9738c074ba47ee",
      "text": "传达吧，应援！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa195ddeff1f8376abc74059f56ebabca1a69cf70418ba5ce26a75a54649000b",
      "text": "FRAME确定将在早间新闻节目中担任为期1个月的\n主题曲演唱者。不仅如此，\n他们还决定客串出演各个环节，\n干劲十足的3人为迎接正式演出展开了练习。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000019:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序章",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000019:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a3207a84868c9856a05337053969479d4b8ba27de6020c39a9738c074ba47ee",
      "text": "传达吧，应援！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000021:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae3d0b4dd59a08740a8a94acfcde8cf9392cc4aeb12dc0adc6dbd3b26a3e5b7c",
      "text": "休息室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ad4705a09969cbc7e0e30640cc2a7384bef998d1c6bea51dbc5d5cf43b3bf4e",
      "text": "呼，流了身好汗啊。\n信玄、龙，训练辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35ae3a1762fadddbfe3a5dcdc6db572278b0b9561ea657fc25a5eb2761853f1d",
      "text": "辛苦了！\n等下是要去电视台开会来着吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df0b87bc19b0f810f6a28fa22cee5e4a2b435c24b69235bf1d21cc8bb8aa2b45",
      "text": "嗯。真没想到我们居然能在早间新闻节目里\n连续1个月担任主题曲的演唱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5432060a85cee1982491932ca0f14c479d8ad48fadce61a6cf98d81d4c39f6be",
      "text": "而且，还要在演播厅进行现场演唱对吧？\n听●●●●プロデューサー说起的时候我还真吃了一惊呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02e07857b7324a72eb10e6e5696fdc9a49fa4a86cd4a265319a938942c54a5b0",
      "text": "这是一个让更多人认识我们的好机会。\n打起精神大干一场吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7",
      "text": "好！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dedfc4c1f3d3d85bd8ce66af9022190c40355e5c8e0cc87384ef1480982dbe5e",
      "text": "……距离出发时间还有些富余。\n我打算再稍微训练一会儿。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ad9623c0f4f4d2b27fd0a5b5ce9c3fc64ba3e5829f006be3e7efbeecc20faa4",
      "text": "我也来！\n刚才只是轻度训练而已嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:934ad4d64576dee19c2a90de697a51e4f89a76073fec490583b3f23435e253d5",
      "text": "诶！？刚才那样算轻度……？\n真不愧是前自卫官和前消防员……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21747a6aceda35a4fa7ae89d6940314578e2827fa10b73a6bd8e54857b2dc603",
      "text": "英雄先生不来吗？您还能动得起来吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_a:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e3bebab5404ec7d00aff3337c6218c06b27bdd57aba4cb7faf2ff4354ec79d1",
      "text": "啊——……也、也是啊。\n稍微陪你们练一会儿倒还可以。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
